<title>PHILIPPINES: PLDT declares 1.60-peso cash div.</title>
<headline>PLDT declares 1.60-peso cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co on Wednesday declared a cash dividend of 1.60 pesos per share to stockholders of record as of September 13.</p>
<p>It also declared a 0.50 peso dividend on its convertible preferred shares.  </p>
<p>In a statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange, PLDT said it will start paying the 1.60 peso-cash dividend to common stockholders on October 15, 1996.</p>
<p>The 0.50-peso cash dividend is being given to holders of convertible preferred series E,K,O and U of record as of September 27, 1996. This will be payable on October 31, 1996, PLDT said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
